# ------------- Amap -------------
移除路线规划推广 = type=http-response, pattern=(?i)^https:\/\/m5\.amap\.com\/ws\/aos\/perception\/publicTravel\/beforeNavi\?, script-path=https://github.com/bunizao/Mirrored/raw/main/Chores/js/Amap_remove_ads.js, requires-body=true
